  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "\"Whiskey\" Bill Yardley, once a high-roller at the Bill Yards pool hall before Subchain City fell, now ekes out a living as a scavenger. Losing everything but his lucky Kicks-Walkers and his beackwear cryo goggles, Yardley is always looking for a payday be it DRIP or otherwise. They say he still hustles pool against radroaches and the undead in the dark corners of the ruins, never losing a game.",
    "class": "Hustler",
    "name": "\"Whiskey\" Bill Yardley",
    "personality": "Cynical: Yardley's seen the best and worst of Subchain City, leading to a general distrust of everyone. Quick-Witted: Years of hustling have honed Yardley's mind, making him sharp and able to think on his feet. Fatalistic: He accepts the bleak reality of Subchain City and doesn't dwell on the past and is looking to survive the next Drip Raid.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Yardley unleashes a blinding flash from his cryo goggles to stun enemies in a cone in the direction he is currently facing. It's enough time to make an escape but, more often, to set up a devastating shot.",
